  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed your case to a specialist, and they'll follow up within 24 hours. The handoff includes everything: your order, the courier's early \"delivered\" mark, the 7:47 PM actual arrival, the cold food, and the $5.60 credit already on your account. You won't have to repeat any of it. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with tonight?"
